{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1788298492378,"sessionID":"ses_fa11b16e3ffejSNgKGkK0vX2sJ","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"read","callID":"call_30c85ca896a44d9cb68a29c4","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/home/kantord/.local/share/toylang-lanes/issue-159/tests/corpus/input_typed_by_first_use.yaml"},"output":"<path>/home/kantord/.local/share/toylang-lanes/issue-159/tests/corpus/input_typed_by_first_use.yaml</path>\n<type>file</type>\n<content>\n1: # Goal program three of the type-flow rework (plans/type-flow.md), verbatim from the\n2: # oddities inventory: the first `input` is typed by `f`'s parameter, and the second use --\n3: # a record field nothing expects anything of -- borrows the type the first use fixed.\n4: program: |\n5:   fn f(v: Vec<Int>) -> Int = length(v)\n6: \n7:   {a: f(input), b: input}\n8: \n9: input: |\n10:   [1, 2, 3]\n11: \n12: output: |\n13:   {\"a\":3,\"b\":[1,2,3]}\n14: \n15: node_types: [application, builtin.length, input, record-literal, var]\n\n(End of file - total 15 lines)\n</content>","metadata":{"preview":"# Goal program three of the type-flow rework (plans/type-flow.md), verbatim from the\n# oddities inventory: the first `input` is typed by `f`'s parameter, and the second use --\n# a record field nothing expects anything of -- borrows the type the first use fixed.\nprogram: |\n  fn f(v: Vec<Int>) -> Int = length(v)\n\n  {a: f(input), b: input}\n\ninput: |\n  [1, 2, 3]\n\noutput: |\n  {\"a\":3,\"b\":[1,2,3]}\n\nnode_types: [application, builtin.length, input, record-literal, var]","truncated":false,"loaded":[],"display":{"type":"file","path":"/home/kantord/.local/share/toylang-lanes/issue-159/tests/corpus/input_typed_by_first_use.yaml","text":"# Goal program three of the type-flow rework (plans/type-flow.md), verbatim from the\n# oddities inventory: the first `input` is typed by `f`'s parameter, and the second use --\n# a record field nothing expects anything of -- borrows the type the first use fixed.\nprogram: |\n  fn f(