loop\". No. Hmm.\n\n\n\nActually wait, I need to recheck. Maybe rg matches filenames too with -l? No, -l only prints filenames of matching files. Let me redo the search more carefully.","format":"unknown","index":0}]}},"id":"prt_05ee59d08001epdjbSmXr6aACW","sessionID":"ses_fa11b16e3ffejSNgKGkK0vX2sJ","messageID":"msg_05ee589bd001Uo7f3YIlaScXE0"}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1788298501401,"sessionID":"ses_fa11b16e3ffejSNgKGkK0vX2sJ","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"bash","callID":"call_123e749509464370993ad65b","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"rg \"stdin\" tests/corpus/ -n"},"output":"tests/corpus/inputs_scalars.yaml:2:# remaining JSON value on stdin, one per line, into a Vec<T> before the program body runs.\ntests/corpus/jsonlines_of_inputs.yaml:2:# reading all of stdin before printing anything: `jsonlines f inputs` where `f`'s own body is\ntests/corpus/jsonlines_of_inputs.yaml:4:# pins the value; tests/streaming.rs is what checks output actually arrives before stdin closes.\ntests/corpus/lines_cat.yaml:1:# The forcing program for this cut: reading stdin incrementally, line by line, on all six\ntests/corpus/lines_preserve_crlf.yaml:2:# stdin iteration, neither of which treats it specially. Go's default scanner strips it,\n","metadata":{"output":"tests/corpus/inputs_scalars.yaml:2:# remaining JSON value on stdin, one per line, into a Vec<T> before the program body runs.\ntests/corpus/jsonlines_of_inputs.yaml:2:# reading all of stdin before printing anything: `jsonlines f inputs` where `f`'s own body is\ntests/corpus/jsonlines_of_inputs.yaml:4:# pins the value; tests/streaming.rs is what checks output actually arrives before stdin closes.\ntests/corpus/lines_cat.yaml:1:# The forcing program for this cut: reading stdin incrementally, line by line, on all six\ntests/corpus/lines_preserve_crlf.yaml:2:# stdin iteration, neither of which treats it specially. Go's default scanner strips it,\n","exit":0,"truncated":false},"title":"rg \"stdin\" tests/corpus/ -n","time":{"start":1788298501399,"end":1788298501400}},"id":"prt_05ee59d0d001Jj24WmQqtkGqnA","sessionID":"ses_fa11b16e3ffejSNgKGkK0vX2sJ","messageID":"msg_05ee589bd001Uo7f3YIlaScXE0"}}
